{"articleNo":"579669","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=579669&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 연극 <산 밖에 다시 산> 무료 초대 안내(26.10.23.)_전화예약 필수","writer":"기획협력과","writeDate":"2026.10.16","hit":"230","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">연극 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">산 밖에 다시 산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">무료초대 안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><b style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">구미역사인물, 송당 ‘박영’(극중 ‘박석’)의 삶을 통해 우리 시대의 철학의 쓰임을 말한다.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;\"><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">◆&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2026. 10. 23</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">오후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">분 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">/ 24</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">오후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">시</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">◆&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">장소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">강동문화복지회관 천생아트홀 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">인동가산로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">392)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">◆&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">관람료 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">무료<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(054-444-0604 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">전화예약 필수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - 국립금오공과대학교&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">교직원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">가족 등 무료초대</span></b></p><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 10px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">◆&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">관람등급 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: 8</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">세 이상 관람 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">◆&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">러닝타임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: 70</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">분&nbsp;</span></p></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px;\">◆</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">수상실적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2024 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">대한민국연극제 본선 은상수상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">             </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2024 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">경북연극제 최우수작품상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">무대미술상 수상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">             </spa